      "rule": "admit each run against independent board time first; the tick channel has a fixed five-event bound (two endpoint ticks per run plus one first-notify phase tick), never D+1; other shared channels admit ceil(longer count * admitted tick difference / larger tick count) + 1 events; one-sided channels have no allowance",
